# Build context of services/event-generator/Dockerfile (MVP-10.1).
#
# This directory is a self-contained Maven project, so the build needs its pom and its sources
# and nothing else. The build output of a local run is excluded: the image builds the jar itself,
# and a `target/` copied into the context would only make the context large and the result
# ambiguous.
target/
**/target/

# Local noise that never belongs in an image.
*.log
*.tmp
.git/
.gitignore
.idea/
.vscode/
